==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is extremely helpful here as it is able to tank the Angelic Gories and Heavenly Hippoes, completely reducing their pushing power. Once you defeat all 3 Angelic Gories, this stage becomes immensely easier.

